: INPUTS
W - The AI wizard's ID who is making the research decision
SPE - The spell being evaluated
CAT - The research category of the evaluated spell
PRIO - The base research prority of the spell (set this in SPELLS.INI)
OUTPUT - PRIO should contain the calculated adjusted research priority.
The spell with the lowest calculated priority will be chosen for research.
:

BOOKNUM=BOOKS(W,1)+BOOKS(W,2)+BOOKS(W,3)+BOOKS(W,4)+BOOKS(W,5);

: Tree of Knowledge is delayed for races that have no armorer's guild, fantastic stable, and Wizard's guild tier unit :
IF (SPE=STreeofKnowledge)
 %AND ( (HOMERACE(W)=RCGnoll) %OR (HOMERACE(W)=RCBarbarian) )
THEN { PRIO=PRIO+380; }

: Summoning Spell duplictes should be be researched later.
Knowing any of
Lycanthropy,War Bears,Sprites,Giant Spiders,Nagas,Hell Hounds,Gargoyles,Guardian Spirit,Unicorns,Skeletons,Ghouls
prevents researching any other, except Gargoyles and Giant Spiders which are low cost and worth the early research anyway.
:
IF (CAT=13) %AND (SPE<>SGargoyles) %AND (SPE<>SGiantSpiders)
%AND ((SPELLSTATE(W,SLycanthropy)=SSKnown) %OR HASSPELLCAT(W,13)) THEN { PRIO=PRIO+400; }

: If we don't have a water movement enabler yet, make that top priority :

IF ((SPE=SWaterWalking) %OR (SPE=SWraithForm) %OR (SPE=SFloatingIsland))
 %AND (SPELLSTATE(W,SWaterWalking)<>SSKnown)
 %AND (SPELLSTATE(W,SWraithForm)<>SSKnown)
 %AND (SPELLSTATE(W,SFloatingIsland)<>SSKnown) 
THEN { PRIO=PRIO-500; }

: Weak combat direct damage +400 IF weak or strong combat direct damage spell already known :
: Includes Fairy Dust	Fire Bolt	Fireball	Life Drain :
IF (CAT=2) %AND (HASSPELLCAT(W,9) %OR HasSpellCat(w,2)) THEN { PRIO=PRIO+400; }

: Weak combat unit curse +200 IF another weak combat unit curse already known 
  Includes Black Sleep	Vertigo	Rust	Warp Creature	Weakness	liability :
IF (CAT=3) %AND HasSpellCat(w,3) THEN { PRIO=PRIO+200; }

: Weak combat summon +400 IF another weak combat summon already known
  Includes Wild Boars	Phantom Warriors	Summon Zombie :
IF (CAT=16) %AND HasSpellCat(w,16) THEN { PRIO=PRIO+400; }

: Prefer Land Linking IF Spiders are known already :
IF (SPE=SLandLinking) %AND (SpellState(W,SGiantSpiders)=SSKnown) THEN { PRIO=PRIO-100; }

: Lycanthropy, Giant Spiders, Gargoyles, the three early uncommon summons. Prioritizing them high is less important past turn 75 or IF one of them is already researched :
IF ((SPE=SLycanthropy) %OR (SPE=SGiantSpiders) %OR (SPE=SGargoyles))
 %AND ((SPELLSTATE(W,SLycanthropy)=SSKnown)
  %OR (SPELLSTATE(W,SGiantSpiders)=SSKnown)
  %OR (SPELLSTATE(W,SGargoyles)=SSKnown)
  %OR (OVERLANDTURN()>=75) 
THEN { PRIO=PRIO+150; }

: We don't want Corruption IF we have Raise Volcano :
IF (SPE=SCorruption) %AND (SpellState(W,SRaiseVolcano)=SSKnown) THEN { PRIO=PRIO+800; }

: Warp Wood is no longer redundant with Guardian Wind since it has been upgraded to Animate Ammo
so this rule is now unnecessary
IF (SPE=SAnimateAmmo) %AND (SpellsState(W,SGuardianWind)=SSKnown) THEN { PRIO=PRIO+800; }
:

: Barbarians want Philosopher's Stone earlier for magic weapons :
IF (SPE=SPhilStone) %AND (HOMERACE(W)=RCBarbarian) THEN { PRIO=550; }

: Perfectionist wizard prefer improved their cities and protect them from curses :
IF (Objective(W)<>Perfectionist) THEN { GOTO "NOPERFECTIONIST"; }

 IF (SPE=SDisenchantArea) THEN { PRIO=740; }
 IF (CAT=44) %OR (CAT=51) %OR (CAT=53) THEN { PRIO=PRIO-200; }

!NOPERFECTIONIST!

: Narcissist wizards prefer improving casting skill and like dispel :
IF (Objective(W)<>Narcissist) THEN { GOTO "NONARCISSIST"; }

 IF (SPE=SAEtherBinding) THEN { PRIO=492; }
 IF (SPE=SUranusBlessing) THEN { PRIO=630; }
 IF (SPE=SPhilstone) THEN { PRIO=493; }
 IF (SPE=SFairyRing) THEN { PRIO=641; }
 IF (SPE=SRulerofHeaven) THEN { PRIO=785; }
 IF (SPE=SDispelMagic) THEN { PRIO=1; }
 IF (SPE=SDisenchantArea) THEN { PRIO=740; }
 IF (SPE=SDispellingWave) THEN { PRIO=121; }

!NONARCISSIST!

: Darkness +900 IF no Ghouls, Werewolves, Shadow Demons known :
IF (SPE=SDarkness) 
 %AND (SpellState(W,SGhouls)<>SSKnown)
 %AND (SpellState(W,SLycanthropy)<>SSKnown)
 %AND (SpellState(W,SShadowDemons)<>SSKnown) 
THEN { PRIO=PRIO+900; }
 
: Uncommon or better, high quality combat damage spells.
Covers spell categories 9, 24, 59, 70, 12. 
We can afford prioritizing these lower IF we don't expect a war with the human player.
While these spells are still decent in automatic combat between AIs, they have much less relevance there.
:

IF (CAT=9) %OR (CAT=24) %OR (CAT=59) %OR (CAT=70) %OR (CAT=12) THEN {
 IF CONTACT(W,0) THEN { PRIO=PRIO+400; }
 IF HOSTILITY(W,0)=HosNone THEN { PRIO=PRIO+100; }
}

: We don't want Sanctify IF we're at war with the human player. 
Unlike AI players, the human is likely to succeed at war and kill the buffed units
and either way the AI should focus on spells with better military value. :
IF (SPE=SSanctify) %AND (Treaty(W,0)=TSWar) THEN { PRIO=2000; }

: Power Link, avoid in the early game IF possible :
IF (SPE=SPowerLink) %AND ((OVERLANDTURN()<170) %AND (DIFFICULTY()<DiffPhantasm)) THEN { PRIO=2100; }

: Divine Order delay IF at least three Chaos or Death books :
IF (SPE=SDivineOrder) %AND ((Books(W,Chaos)>=3) %OR (Books(W,Death)>=3)) THEN { PRIO=1980; }

: 
  Group 25, average uncommon summons
  Cockatrices/Coatl/Fire Giant/Night Stalker/Shadow Demons/Summon Hero
  Group 32, good uncommon/weak rare summons 
  Great Lizard/Chimeras/Chaos Spawn/Demon/Valkyries/Kraken
:
IF (CAT=25) %AND (HasSpellCat(w,25) %OR HasSpellCat(w,32)) THEN { PRIO=PRIO+200; }
IF (CAT=32) %AND HasSpellCat(w,32) THEN { PRIO=PRIO+200; }
IF (CAT=32) %AND (HasSpellCat(w,74) %OR HasSpellCat(w,78) %OR HasSpellCat(w,56)) THEN { PRIO=PRIO+350; }
  
: Obsolete
  Cockatrices set to 145 IF Focus Magic is known
IF (SPE=SCockatrices) %AND (SpellState(W,SFocusmagic)=SSKnown) THEN { PRIO=145; }
:

: Bloodlust/Frenzy set to 21 IF Werewolves known :
IF (SPE=SFrenzy) %AND (SpellState(W,SLycanthropy)=SSKnown) THEN { PRIO=21; }

: 
True Sight +500 IF human player has no Sorcery books 
Possibly obsolete? 
Illusion Immunity now helps in automatic combat to attack invisible enemies
but isn't relevant for melee units. It isn't required for spell damage either.
So probably not obsolete, and still not worth researching vs other AI players.
:
IF (SPE=STrueSight) %AND (Books(0,Sorcery)=0) THEN { PRIO=PRIO+500; }

: Spells to counter Life Realm :
IF (books(0,Life)<4) THEN { GOTO "FEWLIFEBOOKS"; }

 IF (SPE=SDispellingWave) THEN { PRIO=121; }
 IF (SPE=SAEtherBinding) THEN { PRIO=75; }
 IF (SPE=SCracksCall)  THEN { PRIO=121; }
 IF (SPE=SFrenzy) THEN { PRIO=75; }

!FEWLIFEBOOKS!

: Spells to counter Death Realm :
IF Books(0,Death)<4 THEN { GOTO "FEWDEATHBOOKS"; }
 IF (SPE=SWeakness)  THEN { PRIO=67; }
 IF (SPE=SExorcise)  THEN { PRIO=121; }
 IF (SPE=SHolyWord)  THEN { PRIO=562; }
 IF (SPE=SCockatrices)  THEN { PRIO=121; }
 IF (SPE=SPetrify)  THEN { PRIO=562; }
 IF (SPE=SShadowDemons)  THEN { PRIO=121; }
 IF (SPE=SGateOfHades)  THEN { PRIO=562; }

!FEWDEATHBOOKS!

: 
Strong summoning spells category (56)
Includes Stone Giant/Gorgons/Cloud Giant/Efreet/Doom Bat/Angel/Wraiths/Vampire
:
IF (CAT=56)
 %AND ( HasSpellCat(w,74) %OR HasSpellCat(w,78) %OR HasSpellCat(w,56) )
THEN { PRIO=PRIO+400; }
: 
Very rare summoned creatures
:
IF ((CAT=74) %OR (CAT=78)) %AND
 (HasSpellCat(w,74) %OR HasSpellCat(w,78)) THEN { PRIO=PRIO+500; }
 
: Prefer Sky Drake IF Life books (good buff target) 
  Prefer Djinn IF Chaos or Death books (stalls for combat spellcasting) :
IF SPE=SSkyDrake THEN { PRIO=PRIO-2*Books(W,Life); }
IF SPE=SDjinn THEN { PRIO=PRIO-2*Books(w,Chaos)-2*Books(W,Death); }
 
: Artificer :
IF (SPE=SCreateArtifact) %AND Retort(W,Artificer) THEN { PRIO=970; }
 
: Plane Shift 
  Note - Decided not to prioritize in reaction to broken towers,
  and not prioritize breaking towers in reaction to learning plane shift. 
  In general the AI breaking the plane barrier early in game modes where it's not desired
  is bad and should be avoided. :
IF (SPE<>SPlaneShift) THEN { GOTO "NOTPLANESHIFT"; }

 IF (SCORINGOPTION(SRaceToUnknown))
  %OR (SCORINGOPTION(SLoner)
  %OR SCORINGOPTION(SInvertedStart))
 THEN { PRIO=611; } 
 ELSE { 
  IF SpellState(0,SPlaneShift)=SSKnown THEN { PRIO=1118; }
  ELSE {
   IF OverlandTurn()<160 THEN { PRIO=9999; }
  }
 }

!NOTPLANESHIFT!
 
: Inner Power and Insulation :
IF (SPE=SInsulation) %AND (SpellState(W,SInnerPower)=SSKnown) THEN { PRIO=PRIO-500; }

IF (SPE=SInnerPower) THEN { GOTO "NOTINNERPOWER"; }

 IF ((OWNEDFIREIMMUNITY(W)+OWNEDLIGHTNINGRESIST(W))>=18) THEN { PRIO=PRIO-726; }
 IF (SpellState(W,SInsulation)=SSKnown) THEN { PRIO=PRIO-500; }

!NOTINNERPOWER!

: This can counter Doomsday somewhat :
 IF (SPE<>SConsecration) THEN { GOTO "NOTCONSECRATION"; }

 FOR I=0 to NofWizards();

  IF ( DEFEATED(I) = 0 ) %AND (SpellState(I,SDoomsday)=SSKnown) THEN { PRIO=555; }

 NEXT; 

!NOTCONSECRATION!

: This can counter Armageddon & Doomsday somewhat :
IF (SPE<>SGaiaBlessing) THEN { GOTO "NOTGAIABLESSING"; }

 FOR I=0 to NofWizards();

  IF ( DEFEATED(I) = 0 ) %AND (SpellState(I,SArmageddon)=SSKnown) THEN { PRIO=655; }
  IF ( DEFEATED(I) = 0 ) %AND (SpellState(I,SDoomsday)=SSKnown) THEN { PRIO=655; }

 NEXT; 

!NOTGAIABLESSING!

: This can counter Armageddon somewhat :
IF (SPE<>SRootsofGenesis) THEN { GOTO "NOTROOTOFGENESIS"; }

 FOR I=0 to NofWizards();

  IF ( DEFEATED(I) = 0 ) %AND (SpellState(I,SArmageddon)=SSKnown) THEN { PRIO=1162; }

 NEXT; 

!NOTROOTOFGENESIS!

: Prepare for global curse :
IF (SPE<>SDisjunction) THEN { GOTO "NOTDISJUNCTION"; }

 FOR I=0 to NofWizards();

  IF HasGlobal(I,GEDoomsday) THEN { PRIO=PRIO-600; }
  IF HasGlobal(I,GEArmageddon) THEN { PRIO=PRIO-400; }
  IF HasGlobal(I,GEMeteorStorm) THEN { PRIO=PRIO-400; }
  IF HasGlobal(I,GEEvilOmens) THEN { PRIO=PRIO-300; }
  IF HasGlobal(I,GEEternalNight) THEN { PRIO=PRIO-200; }
  IF HasGlobal(I,GEDarkestHour) THEN { PRIO=PRIO-200; }
  IF SpellState(I,SDoomsday)=SSKnown THEN { PRIO=PRIO-100; }
  IF SpellState(I,SArmageddon)=SSKnown THEN { PRIO=PRIO-100; }
  IF SpellState(I,SMeteorStorm)=SSKnown THEN { PRIO=PRIO-100; }
  IF SpellState(I,SEternalNight)=SSKnown THEN { PRIO=PRIO-100; }
  IF SpellState(I,SEvilOmens)=SSKnown THEN { PRIO=PRIO-100; }
  IF SpellState(I,SDarkestHour)=SSKnown THEN { PRIO=PRIO-100; }

 NEXT;

!NOTDISJUNCTION!


IF (SPE<>SBlazingEyes) THEN { GOTO "NOTCHAOSEMBRACE"; }

: spell has combo :
 IF (Spellstate(W,SDarkRitual)=SSKnown) THEN { PRIO=PRIO-100; }
 IF (Spellstate(W,SDoomMastery)=SSKnown) THEN { PRIO=PRIO-200; }

: Chaos Embrace counter global curse somewhat :
 FOR I=0 to NofWizards();

  IF HasGlobal(I,GEDoomsday) THEN { PRIO=PRIO-300; }
  IF HasGlobal(I,GEArmageddon) THEN { PRIO=PRIO-200; }
  IF HasGlobal(I,GEDivineOrder) THEN { PRIO=PRIO-200; }
  IF HasGlobal(I,GEEvilOmens) THEN { PRIO=PRIO-200; }
  IF HasGlobal(I,GEEternalNight) THEN { PRIO=PRIO-100; }
  IF HasGlobal(I,GEDarkestHour) THEN { PRIO=PRIO-100; }

 NEXT;

!NOTCHAOSEMBRACE!


: These increase priority for Call the Wild :
IF (SPE<>SCallTheWild) THEN { GOTO "NOTNATURESEMBRACE"; }

 FOR I=0 to NofWizards();

  IF HasGlobal(I,GECallTheWild) THEN { PRIO=PRIO-500; }
  IF HasGlobal(I,GEChaosSurge) THEN { PRIO=PRIO-200; }
  IF HasGlobal(I,GEBlazingEyes) THEN { PRIO=PRIO-200; }
  IF HasGlobal(I,GEDoomsday) THEN { PRIO=PRIO-200; }

 NEXT;

!NOTNATURESEMBRACE!

: These counters Ruler of Underworld :
IF (SPE<>SKingoftheUnderworld) THEN { GOTO "NOTRULEROFUNDERWORLD"; }

 FOR I=0 to NofWizards();

  IF HasGlobal(I,GEKingOfUnderworld) THEN { PRIO=PRIO-1000; }

 NEXT;

!NOTRULEROFUNDERWORLD!

IF (SPE<>SHolyArms) THEN { GOTO "NOTHOLYARMS"; }

 FOR I=0 to NofWizards();

  IF HasGlobal(I,GEKingOfUnderworld) THEN { PRIO=PRIO-1000; }

 NEXT;

!NOTHOLYARMS!


: This counters Doom Mastery :
IF (SPE<>SGreatUnbinding) THEN { GOTO "NOTGREATUNBINDING"; }

 FOR I=0 to NofWizards();

  IF HasGlobal(I,GEDoomMastery) THEN { PRIO=1590; }

 NEXT;

!NOTGREATUNBINDING!

IF (SPE<>SZombieMastery) THEN { GOTO "NOTZOMBIEMASTERY"; }

 FOR I=0 to NofWizards();

  IF HasGlobal(I,GEDoomMastery) THEN { PRIO=1020; }

 NEXT;

!NOTZOMBIEMASTERY!

IF (SPE<>SHolyWord) THEN { GOTO "NOTHOLYWORD"; }

 FOR I=0 to NofWizards();

  IF HasGlobal(I,GEDoomMastery) THEN { PRIO=PRIO-200; }

 NEXT;

!NOTHOLYWORD!

IF (SPE<>SEvilPresence) THEN { GOTO "NOTEVILPRESENCE"; }

 FOR I=0 to NofWizards();

  IF HasGlobal(I,GEDoomMastery) THEN { PRIO=PRIO-200; }

 NEXT;

!NOTEVILPRESENCE!


: These support Doom Mastery :
IF (HasGlobal(W,GEDoomMastery)=0) THEN { GOTO "NODOOMMASTERY"; }

 IF (SPE=SChaosBlessing) THEN { PRIO=PRIO-500; }
 IF (SPE=SSurvivalInstinct) THEN { PRIO=PRIO-300; }
 IF (SPE=SReinforceMagic) THEN { PRIO=PRIO-300; }
 IF (SPE=SChaosSurge) THEN { PRIO=PRIO-300; }
 IF (SPE=SBlazingEyes) THEN { PRIO=PRIO-200; }

!NODOOMMASTERY!

IF (SPE=SDoomMastery) %AND (SpellState(W,SChaosBlessing)=SSKnown) THEN { PRIO=PRIO-500; }

: These support Zombie Mastery :
IF (HasGlobal(W,GEZombieMastery)=0) THEN { GOTO "NOZOMBIEMASTERY"; }

 IF (SPE=SSurvivalInstinct) THEN { PRIO=PRIO-200; }
 IF (SPE=SHerbMastery) THEN { PRIO=PRIO-200; }
 IF (SPE=SEternalNight) THEN { PRIO=PRIO-200; }

!NOZOMBIEMASTERY!

: These support Survival Instinct :
IF (HasGlobal(W,GESurvivalInstinct)=0) THEN { GOTO "NOSURVIVALINSTINCT"; }

 IF (SPE=SDoomMastery) THEN { PRIO=PRIO-300; }
 IF (SPE=SZombieMastery) THEN { PRIO=PRIO-300; }

!NOSURVIVALINSTINCT!

: Apotheosis get higher priority with Divine Order :
IF (SPE<>SDestiny) THEN { GOTO "NOTAPOTHEOSIS"; }

 IF HasGlobal(W,GEDivineOrder) THEN { PRIO=PRIO-300; }

 FOR I=0 to NofWizards();

  IF Hasglobal(I,GEDivineOrder) THEN { PRIO=PRIO-300; }

 NEXT;

!NOTAPOTHEOSIS!


IF (SPE<>SMagicImmunity) THEN { GOTO "NOTMAGICIMMUNITY"; }

: Magic Immunity is slightly lower priority IF not at war but not by much :
 IF ((Treaty(W,0)<>TSWar)) THEN { PRIO=1645; }

: spell has combo :
 IF (Spellstate(W,SMagicVortex)=SSKnown) THEN { PRIO=1330; }

: But much higher priority during Divine Order due to reduced cost :
 FOR I=0 to NofWizards();

  IF Hasglobal(I,GEDivineOrder) THEN { PRIO=1335; }

 NEXT;

!NOTMAGICIMMUNITY!

: These spells counter Magic Immunity :
IF (SPE<>SCracksCall) THEN { GOTO "NOTCRACKCALL"; }

 FOR I=0 to NofWizards();

  IF (Spellstate(I,SMagicImmunity)=SSKnown) THEN { PRIO=PRIO-220; }
  IF (Spellstate(I,SSkyDrake)=SSKnown) THEN { PRIO=PRIO-220; }

 NEXT;

!NOTCRACKCALL!

IF (SPE<>SCorrosiveBlast) THEN { GOTO "NOTCORROSIVEBLAST"; }

 FOR I=0 to NofWizards();

  IF (Spellstate(I,SMagicImmunity)=SSKnown) THEN { PRIO=PRIO-220; }
  IF (Spellstate(I,SSkyDrake)=SSKnown) THEN { PRIO=PRIO-220; }

 NEXT;

!NOTCORROSIVEBLAST!

: Spell Combos :
IF (SPE=SDisintegrate) %AND (Spellstate(W,SMindStorm)=SSKnown) THEN { PRIO=1602; }
IF (SPE=SAnnihilate) %AND (Spellstate(W,SMindStorm)=SSKnown) THEN { PRIO=1603; }
IF (SPE=SRulerofHeaven) %AND (Spellstate(W,SDarkRitual)=SSKnown) THEN { PRIO=1136; }
IF (SPE=SEnlightenment) %AND (Spellstate(W,SUranusBlessing)=SSKnown) THEN { PRIO=PRIO-400; }
IF (SPE=SUranusBlessing) %AND (Spellstate(W,SAltarofPeace)=SSKnown) THEN { PRIO=PRIO-400; }
IF (SPE=SAltarofPeace) %AND (Spellstate(W,SUranusBlessing)=SSKnown) THEN { PRIO=PRIO-300; }

: We want to prioritize Chaos Surge high IF we have a lot more Chaos units than our enemies :
: And the same is true for Warp Reality :
IF (CHAOSSURGEVALUE(w)<200) THEN { GOTO "NOTENOUGHCHAOS"; }

 IF (SPE=SChaosSurge) THEN { PRIO=1322; }
 IF (SPE=SWarpReality) %AND ((Personality(W)=Peaceful) %OR (Personality(W)=Lawful)) THEN { PRIO=1323; }
 
!NOTENOUGHCHAOS!

: This spell is useless outside of a war with the human because Weapon Immunity doesn't apply in automatic combat : 
IF (SPE=SKingoftheUnderworld) %AND (Treaty(W,0)=TSWar) THEN { PRIO=1695; }
: On the other hand, slowing their research can be pushed behind military relevant spells :
IF (SPE=SDarkestHour) %AND (Treaty(W,0)=TSWar) THEN { PRIO=1696; }
: We also want to avoid this IF we're already behind in research, THEN it's too late to prioritize :
IF (SPE=SDarkestHour) %AND (AIStrategy(W,PDSResearchNeeded)) THEN { PRIO=1798; }

: Lawful and Peaceful wizards don't want curses :
IF (Personality(W)<>Peaceful) %AND (PErsonality(W)<>Lawful) THEN { GOTO "NOTPEACEANDLAW"; }

 IF ((CAT=14) %OR (CAT=52 ) %OR (CAT=57) %OR (CAT=79) %OR (CAT=41) %OR (CAT=34) %OR (CAT=28)) THEN { PRIO=PRIO+300; }

!NOTPEACEANDLAW!

: But Maniacal and Ruthless want them earlier :
IF (Personality(W)<>Maniacal) %AND (Personality(W)<>Ruthless) THEN { GOTO "NOTRUTHLESS"; }

 IF (CAT=52) THEN { PRIO=PRIO-300; }
 IF (CAT=79) THEN { PRIO=PRIO-500; }

!NOTRUTHLESS!

: And this helps targeting those curses at cities
as well as fits the image of a paranoid wizard to have a desire to see everything on the map :
IF (Personality(W)<>Maniacal) THEN { GOTO "NOTMANIACAL"; }

 IF (SPE=SDetectMagic) THEN { PRIO=660; }
 IF (SPE=SClairvoyance) THEN { PRIO=1355; }

!NOTMANIACAL!

: Outlander put less priority on spell that need casting skill until get some spell books :
IF (BOOKNUM>0) THEN { GOTO "NOOUTLANDER"; }

 IF (SPE=SSorcererStone) THEN { PRIO=PRIO+500; }
 IF (SPE=SArcaneConference) THEN { PRIO=PRIO+500; }
 IF (SPE=SWallOfStone) THEN { PRIO=PRIO+500; }
 IF (SPE=SMarkOfConqueror) THEN { PRIO=PRIO+500; }
 IF (SPE=SAstralGate) THEN { PRIO=PRIO+500; }
 IF (SPE=STacticalRecall) THEN { PRIO=PRIO+500; }
 IF (SPE=SMarionetteSummon) THEN { PRIO=PRIO+500; }
 IF (SPE=SBountifulFestivity) THEN { PRIO=PRIO+500; }
 IF (SPE=SGospelOfEvangelism) THEN { PRIO=PRIO+500; }
 IF (SPE=SClockworkTinmen) THEN { PRIO=PRIO+500; }
 IF (SPE=SRebuild) THEN { PRIO=PRIO+500; }
 IF (SPE=SClockworkFactory) THEN { PRIO=PRIO+500; }
 IF (SPE=SLuckyStar) THEN { PRIO=PRIO+500; }
 IF (SPE=SDisheartenProphesy) THEN { PRIO=PRIO+500; }
 IF (SPE=SConjuringPact) THEN { PRIO=PRIO+500; }
 IF (SPE=SSpiritLink) THEN { PRIO=PRIO+500; }
 IF (SPE=SRally) THEN { PRIO=PRIO+500; }
 IF (SPE=SPersuasiveWhisperer) THEN { PRIO=PRIO+500; }
 IF (SPE=SDomainOfEnchanter) THEN { PRIO=PRIO+500; }
 IF (SPE=SStrategicRecall) THEN { PRIO=PRIO+500; }
 IF (SPE=SDivineJudgement) THEN { PRIO=PRIO+500; }
 IF (SPE=SDenoucement) THEN { PRIO=PRIO+500; }
 IF (SPE=STabulaRasa) THEN { PRIO=PRIO+500; }

!NOOUTLANDER!
